/-!
# A093613

Table read by rows: row n is the n-th Primary Phyllotaxis Sequence (PPS), which has F(n+1) terms, where F(n) is the n-th Fibonacci number. For 1 <= k < F(n+1), a(n, k) = -k*F(n-1) mod F(n+1). a(n, F(n+1)) = F(n+1).

The 85 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

